This repository is Munarium Warden: workload identity, delegation, just-in-time credentials, kill switches. It is one
of the nine components of the Munarium Governance Platform, whose architecture,
contracts, roadmap and composition evidence are coordinated from the public hub
iokaio/munarium-platform. It is open source from its first public commit. There
is no proprietary edition of this component; a capability that arrives later is
deferred roadmap work, not a commercial restriction.

It builds on Munarium Server (iokaio/munarium) and Munarium Matrix
(iokaio/munarium-matrix), which are separate repositories under the same
License. Munarium Enterprise is a separate, proprietary distribution built on
those two; it contains no part of this component and nothing here is reserved
for it.

